For factorial, there isn't a standard function like in python, so we make one
long long factorial(int num){
   long long result = 1;
   // loop over the number
   for (int i = num; i>=1; i--){
   result = result * i;
   }
   return result;
}

long long has higher precision for integers than a double does which will start rounding at some point
